<section aria-labelledby="mumbai-faq-heading" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-12">
  <h2 id="mumbai-faq-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Mumbai car rental FAQ</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3 mb-6">A few answers before you plan your trip. See our <a href="/faq" class="font-bold text-indigo-600 hover:underline">full car rental FAQs</a> for more details.</p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5" open><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">What types of cars can I rent in Mumbai?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">The fleet includes hatchbacks, sedans, SUVs and larger family vehicles. You can compare cabs with drivers or use the self-drive filters for seats, transmission, fuel and brand. Confirm the model and availability for your dates before finalising your plans.</p></details>
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Do you provide car rental with driver in Mumbai?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. The with-driver booking page supports Local City, Outstation and Airport trips. Select the option you need, enter your journey details and review the fare for your chosen cab.</p></details>
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Do you offer self-drive cars in Mumbai?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. Select pickup and return dates on the self-drive page, browse the fleet and review rental, deposit and delivery details. The booking form offers home delivery or self pickup; delivery depends on the location.</p></details>
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Do you provide Mumbai airport transfers?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. The airport transfer form offers pickup and drop options for Mumbai T1, Mumbai T2 and Navi Mumbai International Airport. Choose the terminal and provide your area, date and time.</p></details>
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Do you provide car rental in Thane and Navi Mumbai?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">These areas are part of our service coverage. The current self-drive delivery list includes Thane, Airoli, Vashi, Nerul and Panvel. Confirm your exact address and chosen service with our team, as coverage and delivery charges can vary by location.</p></details>
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Can I book a car for local Mumbai travel?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. Use the Local City option on the with-driver page, choose a package, and enter your pickup area and date. Review the included hours and kilometres, extra-kilometre terms and other listed exclusions.</p></details>
    <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5"><summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer">Can I book an outstation car from Mumbai?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-3">Yes. The outstation option supports destinations including Pune, Lonavala, Shirdi and Nashik. Add pickup and return dates to review the estimated distance, billed days and cab fare before sending your request.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

